CE\n4. LINEARLY INTERPOLATE PRESSURES FOR EFFECTIVE WIND AREAS BETWEEN THOSE SCHEDULED OR USE PRESSURES\nFOR THE SMALLER EFFECTIVE WIND AREA\n5. WALL EDGE ZONES CORRESPOND TO ROOF CORNER ZONES, AND WALL INTERIOR ZONES CORRESPOND TO ROOF\nEDGE ZONES SHOWN IN THE DIAGRAM BELOW\n6. SEE COMPONENT AND CLADDING DIAGRAM FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION\nSLOPE 1/4:12\nCOORDINATE HVAC\nCOORDINATE HVAC\nCHASE LOCATIONS W/ TRUSS -TYPICAL CHASE LOCATIONS W/\nEXISTING BUILDING GC AND MECH DWGS 2-POINT BEARING GC AND MECH DWGS\nNOTE: ROOF TRUSS PROFILES ARE DIAGRAMMATIC ONLY. COORDINATE FINAL TRUSS PROFILE, TRUSS DEPTH, ROOF\nSLOPE, OVERHANGS AND OVERALL DIMENSIONS WITH ARCH DWGS\nROOF TRUSS PROFILE COMPONENTS AND CLADDING WIND LOAD SCHEDULE\n2 1\nSCALE : 3/16\" = 1'-0\" SCALE : 1/16\" = 1'-0\"","Colliers\nEngineering\n& Design\nwww.colliersengineering.com\nCopyright © 2024. Colliers Engineering & Design All Rights Reserved. This drawing and all the\ninformation contained herein is authorized for use only by the party for whom the services\nwere contracted or to whom it is certified. This drawing may not be copied, reused, disclosed,\ndistributed or relied upon for any other purpose without the express written consent of\nColliers Engineering & Design.\nFormerly Known as\nREV DATE DESCRIPTION\n11/17/2025 ISSUED FOR PERMIT\nMARCELLO SPINELLI\nAMAZING EXPLORERS\nACADEMY\n101 CHERRY ELM\nDR.,\nST AUGUSTINE, FL\n32092\nFL ENGINEERING\nTAMPA\nColliers 5471 W Waters Ave,\nSte 100\nTampa, FL 33634\nPhone: 813.207.1061\nEngineering\nColliers Engineering &\n& Design\nDesign, Inc.\nPROJECT MANAGER: DISCIPLINE LEAD:\nJAM NC\nDESIGNER: REVIEWER:\nBB NC\nDATE ISSUED: PROJECT NUMBER:\n10/01/2025 25007085A\nSHEET NAME:\nLOAD DIAGRAMS\nDRAWING NUMBER:\nS010"]],[[""],[""]],[[null,"","2 1 '1\nENOZ ENOZ ENOZ","",null,"",null,"",null,"","","",""],[null,null,null,"1 '1\nENOZ ENOZ",null,null,null,null,null,null,"",null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"'1\nENOZ",null,null,null],["","",nul